{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895300/extras/9f199402691a027695a3cb222ab481b4.avif?t=1773640703\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895300/extras/117c7a1d04ae674da51d902d222501d5.avif?t=1773640703\" alt=\"fight2\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895300/extras/aef56aa4840653cbdbef20d999c32e18.avif?t=1773640703\" alt=\"construct1\" width=1560 height=878 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895300/extras/092505045f27fc6bd25095e6c1d3a714.avif?t=1773640703\" alt=\"fight1\" width=1560 height=878 /></span>ourney in <strong>Fengshenyanyi SandBox</strong>, a unique blend of city-building, grand strategy, and real-time mass combat set in the mythological universe of the Chinese\u00a0<i>Investiture of the Gods</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build Your Divine Dynasty:</strong> Establish and manage your celestial city, harnessing divine powers and mortal resources to fuel your war machine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Command Legendary Heroes:</strong> Take direct control of the Third Lotus Prince, <strong>Nezha</strong>, a demigod of unparalleled might and agility, leading your armies from the front lines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Experience Unprecedented Scale:</strong> Engage in colossal real-time battles where <strong>thousands of units clash simultaneously</strong> on a single screen. Witness the breathtaking chaos of true mythological warfare, optimized for stunning performance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In the current Demo, you can experience the core thrill of combat:</strong> <br>Lead Nezha and <strong>an army of 1,000 warriors</strong> into a monumental three-way free-for-all melee. Your foes are not one, but <strong>three distinct and formidable factions</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Corrupt Dynasty of Zhaoge:</strong> The decadent human empire you are destined to overthrow.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Disciplined Roman Legion:</strong> A mysterious force from the West, wielding impeccable shield walls and disciplined tactics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Feudal Japanese Samurai Horde:</strong> A relentless eastern army, striking with swift katana and unwavering bushido spirit.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The robot terminator T-800 T800.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each faction boasts unique units, tactics, and strengths, ensuring every battle is a dynamic and strategic challenge. Will you conquer all?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3895300?t=1773640703","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3895300?t=1773640703","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895300/e377b5df13cf922998c450e6dfce6cb446208430/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773640703","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895300/e377b5df13cf922998c450e6dfce6cb446208430/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773640703","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4273800,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" 