rent Demo, you can experience the core thrill of combat:</strong> <br>Lead Nezha and <strong>an army of 1,000 warriors</strong> into a monumental three-way free-for-all melee. Your foes are not one, but <strong>three distinct and formidable factions</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Corrupt Dynasty of Zhaoge:</strong> The decadent human empire you are destined to overthrow.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Disciplined Roman Legion:</strong> A mysterious force from the West, wielding impeccable shield walls and disciplined tactics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Feudal Japanese Samurai Horde:</strong> A relentless eastern army, striking with swift katana and unwavering bushido spirit.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The robot terminator T-800 T800.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each faction boasts unique units, tactics, and strengths, ensuring every battle is a dynamic and strategic challenge. Will you conquer all?</p>","developers":["\u90ed\u6210\u8c6a"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895300/f9e1ae0a7e04a39c5d810198683640a66fec3f33/header.jpg?t=1773640703","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3895300/859352054/64896142021f1b0d470a64c8af53d54220009b55/1773590363/dash_av1.mpd?t=1773590646","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3895300/859352054/64896142021f1b0d470a64c8af53d54220009b55/1773590363/dash_h264.mpd?t=1773590646","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3895300/859352054/64896142021f1b0d470a64c8af53d54220009b55/1773590363/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1773590646","id":257303942,"name":"team","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.c